    | name | tier | blue cost | red cost | rev | val | blue maint | red maint | sector | requires | also requires | tag | copies |
    | Market Crash |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | 1 |
    | Streaming Service | Tier 2 | 10 | 0 | 6 | 6 | 2 | 0 | Consumer | Social |  | Media | 1 |
