    | Neural Social Grid | Tier 3 | 18 | 0 | 2 | 24 | 3 | 0 | Consumer | Media | Bio |  | 1 |
    | DAO Nation | Tier 3 | 20 | 0 | 0 | 28 | 2 | 0 | FinTech | Crypto | Social |  | 1 |
    | Asteroid Mining | Tier 3 | 8 | 18 | 12 | 18 | 0 | 3 | Deep Tech | Robotics | Cloud |  | 1 |
